  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ret100-500.html",
  "prefLabel": "Ret 304.12 Appeal",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-10-10",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ret 304.12 Appeal. Any order or other decision set forth in a NHRS notice of contribution and earnable compensation adjustment or notice of service adjustment issued pursuant to Ret 304.03 may be appealed by timely filing a written petition that meets the requirements of Ret 200.\n\nSource. #7478, eff 4-10-01; ss by #7573, eff 10-10-01, EXPIRED: 10-10-09\n\nNew. #9562, eff 10-14-09; ss by #10111, eff 4-11-12; ss by #12707, eff 1-9-19",
